nt-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__summary">IRDAI reviews progress on universal insurance coverage target with focus on rural areas.</p><!----></article><article _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item" aria-label="Industry sees strongest growth since FY23 as new business premium crosses ₹4 trillion"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__meta"><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__date"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 05 May 2024</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__source">Business Standard</span><!----></div><a _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 target="_blank" class="news-item__title" href="#">Industry sees strongest growth since FY23 as new business premium crosses ₹4 trillion</a><p _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__summary">Driven by GST cuts, product launches and recovery after regulatory changes.</p><!----></article><article _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item" aria-label="IRDAI Chairman advocates smart regulation and deregulation"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__meta"><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__date"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 02 May 2024</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__source">Financial Express</span><!----></div><a _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 target="_blank" class="news-item__title" href="#">IRDAI Chairman advocates smart regulation and deregulation</a><p _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__summary">Ajay Seth emphasizes balance between compliance with growth and economic activity.</p><!----></article><article _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item" aria-label="IRDAI forms panel to assess insurance coverage, claims, product design"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__meta"><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__date"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 29 Apr 2024</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__source">IRDAI Press</span><!----></div><a _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 target="_blank" class="news-item__title" href="#">IRDAI forms panel to assess insurance coverage, claims, product design</a><p _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__summary">Panel to suggest regulatory and operational steps to boost penetration, trust, and innovation.</p><!----></article><article _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item" aria-label="Health insurance premiums may fall after IRDAI review of senior citizen policies"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__meta"><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__date"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 22 Apr 2024</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__source">LiveMint</span><!----></div><a _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 target="_blank" class="news-item__title" href="#">Health insurance premiums may fall after IRDAI review of senior citizen policies</a><p _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="news-item__summary">IRDAI directed insurers to develop specialized policies for senior citizens.</p><!----></article><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="main-grid__right"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 aria-label="Updates, Tenders and Recruitment" class="content-box content-box--right"><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 role="tablist" class="content-box__tabs content-box__tabs--right"><button _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 role="tab" class="content-box__tab content-box__tab--active"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Updates </button><button _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 role="tab" class="content-box__tab"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice"></i> Tenders </button><button _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 role="tab" class="content-box__tab"><i _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i> Recruitment </button></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="content-box__panel"><ul _ngcontent-ng-c876220805 class="notice-list notice-list--compact">